# Enter with a held modifier is another command, so Enter waits for the
# release. dictation AC-29.
0 in sock connect
0 in key KEY_LEFTALT down
500 in key KEY_LEFTALT up
350 out sock start 0
500 out sock stop 500
800 in key KEY_LEFTALT down
900 in key KEY_LEFTALT up
1500 in sock paste
1500 out key KEY_LEFTSHIFT down
1500 out key KEY_INSERT down
1500 out key KEY_INSERT up
1500 out key KEY_LEFTSHIFT up
1500 out sock pasted
1600 in key KEY_RIGHTSHIFT down
1600 out key KEY_RIGHTSHIFT down
1720 in key KEY_RIGHTSHIFT up
1720 out key KEY_RIGHTSHIFT up
1750 in tick
1750 out key KEY_ENTER down
1750 out key KEY_ENTER up
